WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.088 --> 00:00:02.289
Costa Rica, the rich coast.

00:00:03.009 --> 00:00:06.430
Christopher Columbus gave this name to
this land he discovered on his fourth

00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:07.850
voyage to the New World.

00:00:08.538 --> 00:00:12.640
Costa Rica is the realm of microclimates
and a wealth of living species.

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:20.402
This small Central American country owes
its natural riches to its unique

00:00:20.442 --> 00:00:22.962
geographic situation, for it straddles

00:00:23.042 --> 00:00:26.683
North and South America and is under the
influence of two oceans.

00:00:29.476 --> 00:00:33.219
Crossing Costa Rica gives a speeded up
version of the history of the world.

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:37.523
There is a chain of volcanoes running
right through the middle of this small

00:00:37.603 --> 00:00:40.205
country that contains 4% of the planet's

00:00:40.245 --> 00:00:41.026
biodiversity.

00:00:44.836 --> 00:00:49.600
Costa Rica is working to achieve a perfect
equilibrium between economic development

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:51.301
and respect for the environment.

00:00:51.962 --> 00:00:57.167
It is hoping to become the planet's first
carbon neutral country by the year 2021.

00:01:03.544 --> 00:01:07.849
Costa Rica's volcanoes present some of the
country's most breathtaking landscapes.

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:11.874
These nearly perfect cones are constantly
monitored.

00:01:12.835 --> 00:01:18.882
Of the 116 volcanoes that dot this land of
mountain and forest, five are active and

00:01:18.883 --> 00:01:19.663
can sometimes be

00:01:19.723 --> 00:01:20.423
dangerous.

